  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Often used like *gustar*: the subject is what is missing — *me falta dinero* (I'm lacking money / money is missing for me)",
    "Common uses: absence (*faltó a clase* = he was absent from class), lacking (*falta tiempo* = there's not enough time), remaining (*faltan dos días* = two days to go)",
    "*faltar a* = to miss/skip (faltar a clase, faltar a una cita)",
    "Past participle: faltado"
